    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A vertical column of fire roars down from the in a location you specify. Each creature in a 10-foot-radius, 40-foot-high cylinder centered on a point within range must make a Constitution saving throw. A creature takes 5d8 fire damage and 5d8 radiant damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.\nAt Higher Levels: When you use this creaiton with a creation slot of 6th level or higher, the fire damage or the radiant damage (your choice) increases by 1d8 for each slot level above 5th.</p>",
